// How each kind of target is aimed (`docs/rules/casting.md` sections 5 to
// 7): one row for each, named as `Targeting` names it.
//
//   takes     whom its first aim takes: the caster; a friend reached; the
//             party; the foe aimed at, or the nearest ahead, among those
//             reached; every foe reached. Unaimed: the game does not
//             resolve such a spell unless it has a working of its own.
//   spreads   what its power spreads it over once known: nothing; the rest
//             of the foe's group; a cone from the caster's eye toward the
//             foe; a blast at the foe's feet; at the party, the monsters on
//             the party's side about it (a member's only)
//   strays    where a blind caster's spell goes astray: nowhere; at another
//             body; at another's group; a cone or a blast toward a spot
//             scattered within its reach (retail `ScatterSpellPointTarget`)
//   falls     what a backfire falls on (retail `PrepareSpellTarget`,
//             `RedirectBackfiredSpellTarget`): the caster; the caster's
//             whole group; the caster's side within its radius of the
//             caster; the caster's side the caster reaches
//   from      whom a backfire comes from and where it is let go: the
//             caster; the body aimed at; the leader of the group aimed at;
//             the spot it went off toward; the spot a blast goes off at,
//             which its missiles fly to
//   returns   what Eye for an Eye turns it back as (retail
//             `FinishSpellEffectTargets`): on its owner, from the body aimed
//             at; on its owner's group, from the group's leader; a blast, a
//             cone or every foe reached, from where it went off; or no one
{
    Caster: (takes: Caster, spreads: Nothing, strays: Nowhere, falls: Caster, from: Caster, returns: NoOne),
    Ally: (takes: Friend, spreads: Nothing, strays: AtOne, falls: Caster, from: Aimed, returns: NoOne),
    Party: (takes: Party, spreads: Widen, strays: Nowhere, falls: Fellows, from: Caster, returns: NoOne),
    Enemy: (takes: Foe, spreads: Nothing, strays: AtOne, falls: Caster, from: Aimed, returns: Owner),
    EnemyGroup: (takes: Foe, spreads: Group, strays: AtGroup, falls: Group, from: Leader, returns: Group),
    Cone: (takes: Foe, spreads: Cone, strays: Cone, falls: Fellows, from: Spot, returns: Cone),
    Radius: (takes: Foe, spreads: Blast, strays: Blast, falls: Blast, from: SpotToSpot, returns: Blast),
    AllEnemies: (takes: Reached, spreads: Nothing, strays: Nowhere, falls: Fellows, from: Caster, returns: Reached),
    Point: (takes: Unaimed, spreads: Nothing, strays: Nowhere, falls: Caster, from: Caster, returns: NoOne),
    Item: (takes: Unaimed, spreads: Nothing, strays: Nowhere, falls: Caster, from: Caster, returns: NoOne),
    LockOrTrap: (takes: Unaimed, spreads: Nothing, strays: Nowhere, falls: Caster, from: Caster, returns: NoOne),
}
